      "problem": "Let $A$ be a $4\\times 4$ matrix with the characteristic polynomial $p(\\lambda )={\\lambda }^{4}+2{\\lambda }^{3}-10{\\lambda }^{2}+12.$ Then, ${A}^{4}=$",
